          "evidence": "Jobber is a B2B SaaS platform for SMB home service businesses. Adding more customers does not make the product more valuable for existing ones. There is no marketplace dynamic (Jobber does not connect service businesses to end consumers), no user-generated content flywheel, and no shared data layer that benefits the network with scale. The Home Depot integration is a distribution channel advantage (scored under custom moat if applicable), not a network effect.",
